8,Ears of the People: Ekonting Songs from Senegal and The Gambia,https://folkways.si.edu/ears-of-the-people/ekonting-songs-from-senegal-and-the-gambia,"Ears of the People is a collection of sublime contemporary recordings of the ekonting, a three-stringed gourd lute played by Jola people in Gambia and the Casamance region of Senegal. The nine tradition-bearers featured on the album share stories of love, heartache, conflict, spirituality, and all that is unique and beautiful in Jola culture over the rolling lilt of the instrument. An ...",Jola-Kasa,Niger-Congo
